  <metadata>
    <title>UAT round 6 (1-3) — the "+ New" create form: a "Create New Record" title above the type pills, switching the pill switches the form's type, Cancel (left) exits, Create (right)</title>
    <phase>6 UAT round 6 (2026-10-06)</phase>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies production `.tsx` (`CreateRecordForm.tsx`, `RelatedToPicker.tsx`) and their tests.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Client-only layout/flow change, fully decided by the owner.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>UAT6-W1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Runs beside 102 and 103. Disjoint: 101 owns `CreateRecordForm.tsx`, `RelatedToPicker.tsx`, `useCreateRecordFormData.ts` and their tests; it MUST NOT edit `FindView.tsx`, `FindResultsList.tsx`, `TaskPaneShell.tsx`, `TaskPaneToolbar.tsx`, `taskPaneWidthService.ts`, `App.tsx`, `webpack.config.js` or `ci-gated-suites.txt` (report new suites to the main session instead). Client-only.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>100</deps>
